Ryan Hefferan wrote:
>
> I have heard rumots of being able to convert any altar to your gods altar or
> at least to a coaligned altar..is thier any trruth to the rumour? if so, how
> do i do it?

Not *quite" "all" altars.  Make very certain it is already lawfull,
neutral or chaotic.  Altars in Gehennom and at least one Quest
can be found that are unaligned and those can't be converted.

The rest others have discussed so I'll review -

Doing the conversion takes a fresh corpse so don't bother with
a mummy or zzombie and don't bother hauled a corpse from
another level.  The command is #offer.

If you have reason to believe your diety is angry with you, you
should probably work hard to find an altar already your alignment
first.  If you deal with unicorns memorize the table first.  If you
aren't chaotic you own race is a bad idea - Even if you are chaotic
it tends to be a bad idea.

Your level influences the chances of success so don't try until
you're at least XP 5+.



